CLI.md §2.3, I18N.md B5: --lang fr is accepted when the project has that language, and a message with no translation (compiler diagnostics have no key, K8) stays in the source language.
-- args --
check
--lang
fr
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
  languages: [en, fr]
}
-- a/a.canon --
package a

const = 1
-- a/a.fr.canon --
package a
translation fr
-- want --
[exit 1]
[stdout]
error[E1116]  a/a.canon:3:7
  expected IDENT; found =

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
[stderr]
